      <shape width="248" height="100" topLeftX="664" topLeftY="330" type="text" id="bje">
        <content fontSize="12" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(38, 34, 29, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.7">
          <p><strong><span color="rgba(176, 122, 46, 1)">改为　</span></strong>给出预测区间等不确定性刻画，并对那段历史高值时段单独标记，避免平均指标掩盖这种结构性偏差。</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <line id="bjc" startX="48" startY="450" endX="912.0005787035097" endY="450">
        <border color="rgba(216, 209, 192, 1)" width="1" />
      </line>
      <shape width="864" height="40" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="462" type="text" id="bjM">
        <content fontSize="13.5" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(94, 42, 42, 1)" bold="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4">
          <p>方法论含义：先审计误差结构、再决定是否改模型——把「模型学不会」与「输入信息里本来就没有」严格区分开。</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <line id="bjO" startX="48" startY="508" endX="912.0005787035097" endY="508">
        <border color="rgba(201, 192, 172, 1)" width="1" />
      </line>
      <shape width="560" height="16" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="514" type="text" id="bjl">
        <content textType="caption" fontSize="9" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(150, 143, 130, 1)" wrap="false">
          <p>结论基于对该站逐月观测与环境变量的逐项排查</p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="112" height="16" topLeftX="800" topLeftY="514" type="text" id="bjw">
        <content textType="caption" fontSize="9" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(150, 143, 130, 1)" textAlign="right" wrap="false">
